  "display_title": "The Secret of His Scent",
  "description": "The Dawson Group changed the world with their line of pheromone-regulating medications. The long line of alphas in the Dawson family has never failed to uphold that legacy—until now. Henry, the eldest son and successor, has a secret that could ruin his family’s reputation and bring down the company if it were ever to get out. He’s a beta, borrowing the alpha pheromones of his adopted brother, Raz. With so much at stake, will he be able to accept his illicit desires to keep this arrangement?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
